# shared-types — Progress (Split 13 rewrite)

Tracks progress converting this package from Check! to Split 13. Tags reflect how much Split-13-specific work each file needs, not whether the current Check! code works.

Legend: [COMPLETE] done for Split 13 (either ported, rewritten, or needed no change) · [IN PROGRESS] being worked on now · [NEEDS WORK] exists, must change/be replaced/repurposed · [MISSING] doesn't exist yet, needs to be created · [WARNING] works but flagged for review · [ERROR] known bug

Updated: 2026-08-30. Update this file in the same pass as any change to a listed file.

## Top-level config

- package.json — [COMPLETE] — renamed and described for Split 13.
- tsconfig.json — [COMPLETE]

## src/

- index.ts — [COMPLETE] — rewritten for Split 13 and building clean. Now holds:
  - Table constants `SEAT_COUNT` (4), `CARDS_PER_PLAYER` (13), `DEFAULT_TURN_TIMER_MS` (20s).
  - `GameStage` (WAITING_FOR_PLAYERS, DEALING, PLAYING, SCORING, GAMEOVER), `Team` (A/B), `PlayerStatus`, `BotDifficulty` (EASY/NORMAL/HARD).
  - `Card`/`Suit`/`CardRank` carried over unchanged — still a standard 52-card deck.
  - Scoring: `CARD_POINTS`, `cardPoints`, `cardsPoints`, `FULL_DECK_POINTS` (400), `teamForSeat`, `opposingTeam`.
  - `Player` (hand populated only for the viewing player, `handCount` always), `CaptureInfo`, `HandResult`, `ClientSplitGameState`.
  - `PlayerActionType` collapsed to lobby actions + `THROW_CARD` + rematch + chat; `ThrowCardPayload`, `ClaimSeatPayload`, `SetBotDifficultyPayload`.
  - Socket contract kept (ack-based create/join/rejoin, broadcast state/log/chat); peek/ability events removed.
  - All Check!-only shapes gone: `TurnPhase`, `FacedownCard`/`PublicCard`, `ActiveAbility`, ability payloads, `PublicPeek/Swap/Penalty`, matching-opportunity, seal/lock flags.

## Notes

- `RichGameLogMessage.tags` now uses Split 13's vocabulary: `throw` and `capture` replaced `ability` and `penalty`.
